      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Where emergency situations provided for herein occur on a regular basis, although the particular situation that arises cannot be foreseen, Agencies experiencing such recurrences, or anticipating that they will take place shall do the following:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
