        1122,
        1061
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(a) Prepare and submit to the Mayor a description of the type of recurring emergency that the Agency forsees, together with a plan for his approval for dealing with such situations. The plan shall include a statement of: (1) the way in which the Agency will insure that competitive bids can be obtained prior to the actual emergency, and (2) the steps the Agency is taking to limit the number of such emergency situations.",
